{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101454","id":2272302677,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HcJZV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101454","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101454.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101454.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101454","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101454/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101454/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101454/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/48882f3ca417ddf570463e9a7d18d2605f1be2ed","number":101454,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Wayland: Handle `fifo_v1` and clean up suspension logic","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Before, the WSI was unfortunately quite broken and we had work around it by manually pacing frames. Needless to say it was not an ideal solution.\r\n\r\nNow, the WSI can make use of the new fifo_v1 protocol to work properly. If it's available, we'll trust the WSI by disabling manual frame pacing.\r\n\r\nWhile we're at it, let's clean up the suspension code a bit by removing some duplicated stuff and handling the suspension state through a switch case.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNote that fifo_v1 seems to be only used by the Vulkan WSI and not mesa's EGL implementation. For the time being the opengl backend will always manually throttle frames. I only found out about this while writing this PR.\r\n\r\nAs usual with this part of the backend, we need thorough testing for every combination. I did my best to try every compositor I could find but regular use with stuff like LSPs would be better.\r\n\r\nNote that to try this new protocol you're going to need mesa starting from commit [63cbbf2a1c80742a4485417d984b1426b5262ac7](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/63cbbf2a1c80742a4485417d984b1426b5262ac7) and one of the following:\r\n\r\n - mutter commit starting from [fd39ca9f2096aea7d59fd9e4a774a05d6c8cb7d4](https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/commit/fd39ca9f2096aea7d59fd9e4a774a05d6c8cb7d4)\r\n - kwin commit starting from [9a9443e0a2d6ec102f5de7235109f29e6be60c99](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/commit/9a9443e0a2d6ec102f5de7235109f29e6be60c99)\r\n - [jay compositor](https://github.com/mahkoh/jay) starting from version 1.7.0\r\n\r\nThere's also a WIP wlroots implementation but I had issues during my initial tests a month or two ago. If you want to play around with it it's over at MR [!4463](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wlroots/wlroots/-/merge_requests/4463)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TG